// title: Anomalous Group Policy Discovery · Sentinel
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Identity
// tables: IdentityQueryEvents
// purpose: Adversaries may gather information on Group Policy settings to identify paths for privilege escalation, security measures applied within a domain, and to discover patterns in domain objects that can be manipulated or used to blend in the environment. Group policies may contain valueble information f
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Defender%20For%20Identity/AnomalousGroupPolicyDiscovery.md
// kind: repo
// author: Bert-Jan Pals
